Package: ytm-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Description: Minimal, hardened desktop shell for YouTube Music
 YTM Shell is a secure desktop client for YouTube Music developed in Rust
 with Tauri. It features multi-layered adblocking, WebKitGTK sandboxing,
 MPRIS D-Bus integration, global media shortcuts, and persistent login.
